{%- comment -%} Mount Sun Moon — English homepage (rendered from sections/mss-home.liquid when the store language is English) {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="mss" lang="en">

  <section class="mss-hero">
    <div class="mss-hero__media">
      <img src="{{ img_hero }}&width=1800" alt="A cup of pour-over coffee on a wooden table in soft morning window light" width="1536" height="1024" fetchpriority="high">
    </div>
    <div class="mss-hero__text">
      <p class="mss-eyebrow">Specialty drip-bag coffee from Taiwan · Christmas 2026 limited release</p>
      <h1 class="mss-h1">The silent mountain<br>holds the light of sun and moon.</h1>
      <p class="mss-lead">Five roasters, five fires, one box.<br>A good cup of coffee brings more light to life.</p>
      <div class="mss-btns mss-hero__btns">
        <a class="mss-btn mss-btn--ghost" href="#positioning">Our story</a>
        <a class="mss-btn mss-btn--ghost" href="#glimmer">Glimmer Project</a>
        <a class="mss-btn" href="#shop">Shop now</a>
        <a class="mss-btn mss-btn--ghost mss-btn--wide" href="#artisans">Meet the five roasters</a>
        <a class="mss-btn mss-btn--ghost mss-btn--wide" href="#gifting">Corporate & custom gifts</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ul class="mss-trust">
    <li><strong>5</strong>independent roasters</li>
    <li><strong>6</strong>high-mountain origins</li>
    <li><strong>NT$1,000+</strong>free shipping in Taiwan</li>
    <li><strong>5%</strong>to children's arts classes</li>
  </ul>

  <section class="mss-sec mss-sec--paper" id="positioning">
    <div class="mss-split">
      <div>
        <p class="mss-eyebrow">Our Positioning</p>
        <h2 class="mss-h2">One box, five crafts</h2>
        <p>Mount Sun Moon is not a roastery with a single house style. It is a <strong>curated</strong> coffee brand. Opening the box is like walking into a small coffee exhibition, or setting out on a coffee journey: five roasters each bring the one bean that best represents them — one is known for precise, clean light-roast acidity, one has taught coffee for twenty years, one carries green beans from his family's farm all the way to Taiwan.</p>
        <p>When we say <strong>“artisans”, we mean the roasters</strong>. The same green bean tastes completely different depending on how the heat, time and temperature are handled; roasting is the craft of translating a place into flavour.</p>
        <p>Mount Sun Moon is the curator: we select, arrange and tell the story behind every bean, then put all five into one box. One bag a day, five days, five mountains, five fires — and along the way you find the one you love. Together the five flavours stand for balance across the five elements: metal, wood, water, fire and earth.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mss-compare">
        <div class="mss-compare__row"><span>Curated and signed</span><p>Collect the craft of five independent roasters at once; every bag carries a name and a story.</p></div>
        <div class="mss-compare__row"><span>A balanced map of flavour</span><p>Crossing the lines between houses to draw a complete, balanced map of taste in one box.</p></div>
        <div class="mss-compare__row"><span>Quiet and minimal</span><p>Less plastic, cloth materials and a restrained palette of navy, gold and silver, made to stay with you day to day.</p></div>
        <div class="mss-compare__row"><span>Back to the land</span><p>Focused on layers of flavour, the roaster's spirit and everyday beauty, so every bag has a name that answers for it.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mss-sec mss-giving" id="glimmer">
    <div class="mss-giving__num">5%</div>
    <div>
      <p class="mss-eyebrow">Impact & Giving</p>
      <h2 class="mss-h2">Christmas Glimmer Project</h2>
      <p>For every box in this Christmas first release, we donate 5% of the tax-inclusive price (excluding shipping) to the arts and music programmes of LIA Lumière International Academy, an experimental school in Taiwan.</p>
      <p>This winter, the coffee in your hands is a journey of flavour and a gift of art for children. Once this batch has shipped, we will publish the amount donated and a record of the classes.</p>
      <div class="mss-tally">
        <p class="mss-tally__label">Donated so far</p>
        {%- if donation_total > 0 -%}
          <p class="mss-tally__num">NT${{ donation_total }}</p>
          <p class="mss-tally__meta">From {{ donation_boxes }} paid boxes · as of {{ donation_updated }} · updated weekly</p>
        {%- else -%}
          <p class="mss-tally__meta">Pre-orders have just opened; the total starts with the first paid order and is updated weekly.</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <div class="mss-btns"><a class="mss-btn" href="#shop">Choose a box and share the light</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mss-sec" id="shop">
    <div class="mss-head">
      <p class="mss-eyebrow">Pre-order Collection</p>
      <h2 class="mss-h2">Choose a box, meet five ways of roasting</h2>
      <p class="mss-sub">Limited Christmas first release, while stocks last. The 5-pack and 10-pack stay in our regular range after Christmas.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mss-plans">
      {%- for p in (1..3) -%}
        {%- case p -%}
          {%- when 1 -%}{%- assign prod = p5 -%}{%- assign img = img_pour | append: '&width=1100' -%}{%- assign tag = 'For yourself' -%}{%- assign limit = 'First release: 100 boxes' -%}{%- assign give = 'About NT$13 per box' -%}{%- assign cups = '5 bags · 5 cups' -%}{%- assign cap = '' -%}{%- assign name = 'Drip-Bag Discovery Set (5)' -%}
          {%- when 2 -%}{%- assign prod = p10 -%}{%- assign img = p10.featured_image | image_url: width: 1100 -%}{%- assign tag = 'To give or keep' -%}{%- assign limit = 'First release: 70 boxes' -%}{%- assign give = 'NT$26 per box' -%}{%- assign cups = '10 bags · 10 cups' -%}{%- assign cap = '' -%}{%- assign name = 'Drip-Bag Gift Set (10)' -%}
          {%- when 3 -%}{%- assign prod = pbox -%}{%- assign img = img_gift | append: '&width=1100' -%}{%- assign tag = 'Christmas only' -%}{%- assign limit = 'Limited to 25 boxes' -%}{%- assign give = 'NT$59 per box' -%}{%- assign cups = '10 bags + kettle + rice crackers' -%}{%- assign cap = 'Styled image; real photos once packaging is final' -%}{%- assign name = 'Christmas Collector’s Gift Box' -%}
        {%- endcase -%}
        {%- if prod != blank -%}
        <article class="mss-plan{% if p == 3 %} mss-plan--feature{% endif %}">
          <a href="{{ prod.url }}" class="mss-plan__img">
            <img src="{{ img }}" alt="{{ name | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="1100" height="1100">
            <span class="mss-badge">{{ tag }}</span>
            {%- if cap != blank -%}<span class="mss-cap">{{ cap }}</span>{%- endif -%}
          </a>
          <div class="mss-plan__body">
            <p class="mss-plan__limit">{{ limit }}{% unless prod.available %} · Sold out{% endunless %}</p>
            <h3 class="mss-h3"><a href="{{ prod.url }}">{{ name }}</a></h3>
            <p class="mss-plan__price">{{ prod.price | money_without_currency | remove: '.00' | prepend: 'NT$' }}</p>
            <p class="mss-plan__cups">{{ cups }}</p>
            <p class="mss-plan__anchor">
              {%- case p -%}
                {%- when 1 -%}<s>NT$55 × 5 = NT$275</s><span>NT$53 per bag</span>
                {%- when 2 -%}<s>NT$55 × 10 = NT$550</s><span>NT$52 per bag</span>
                {%- when 3 -%}<span>Christmas-only set: 10 bags, a pour-over kettle and rice crackers in one box</span>
              {%- endcase -%}
            </p>
            <ul class="mss-list">
              {%- case p -%}
                {%- when 1 -%}
                  <li>One bag from each of the five roasters</li>
                  <li>Paper box with a carry string, no plastic bag</li>
                  <li>A first taste, or your own morning ritual</li>
                {%- when 2 -%}
                  <li>Two bags from each of the five roasters</li>
                  <li>Comes in a black cotton drawstring pouch with the gold Mount Sun Moon mark</li>
                  <li>For gifting, or for yourself</li>
                {%- when 3 -%}
                  <li>Two bags from each of the five roasters</li>
                  <li>Limited Kobayashi rice crackers</li>
                  <li>Mount Sun Moon travel pour-over kettle</li>
                  <li>Gift box with a Mount Sun Moon Christmas card</li>
              {%- endcase -%}
            </ul>
            <p class="mss-plan__give">{{ give }} goes to children's arts and music classes</p>
            {%- if prod.available -%}
              <form method="post" action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" class="mss-plan__form">
                <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ prod.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}">
                <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
                <button type="submit" class="mss-btn mss-btn--full">Add to cart</button>
              </form>
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="mss-btn mss-btn--full mss-btn--disabled">Sold out</span>
            {%- endif -%}
            <a href="{{ prod.url }}" class="mss-link">View details →</a>
          </div>
        </article>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
    <p class="mss-swipe">← Swipe for more →</p>
    <p class="mss-note">Single bag NT$55 — the more you buy, the less each bag costs. Free shipping in Taiwan on orders over NT$1,000; otherwise NT$85. Photos are styled images; actual packaging may vary.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mss-sec mss-biz" id="gifting">
    <div class="mss-biz__card">
      <div class="mss-biz__text">
        <p class="mss-eyebrow">Gifting & Custom Orders</p>
        <h2 class="mss-h2">Corporate gifts, year-end parties and custom coffee gift boxes</h2>
        <p class="mss-meta">Co-branded boxes · your logo · year-end gifts · Lunar New Year · staff benefits · client thank-yous</p>
        <p>For year-end parties, Lunar New Year greetings, staff gifts, client thank-yous, trade-show giveaways or group orders, Mount Sun Moon can put together specialty drip-bag coffee gift sets for you. Orders of 100 sets or more receive corporate pricing, and we can print your logo on the box for a co-branded gift.</p>
        <ol class="mss-biz__steps">
          <li><span>1</span>Tell us on LINE or by email: purpose, quantity, budget and delivery date</li>
          <li><span>2</span>We suggest a set and send a quote</li>
          <li><span>3</span>Once the content and design are confirmed, we produce and ship</li>
        </ol>
        <div class="mss-btns">
          <a class="mss-btn" href="https://lin.ee/qiXpWYM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask on LINE</a>
          <a class="mss-btn mss-btn--ghost" href="mailto:hello@mountsunmoon.com">Email us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

