      <h2 class="mss-h2">Five roasters, five fires</h2>
      <p class="mss-sub">Our “artisans” are the roasters. Each chose one signature bean for the box. The fifth bag is either Elias's limited Honduras or Fetod's Indonesian Golden Mandheling, at random (it cannot be chosen).</p>
    </div>
